From d8adf4f706462cc57eab6f6b7d2c2c13f25ee55d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zhaosiying12138 <neucszhaopeng2016@163.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 12:22:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 062/212] codegen: row-broadcast fused pointwise inputs

FusedPointwiseV2 now accepts row-expand operands: a [M,1,...] input
parameter materializes through a TensorIR broadcast before the base
arithmetic op. Broadcast inputs may feed only row-expand operands, and
row-expand operands must reference broadcast-shaped inputs; everything
else fails closed as before. This unlocks norm/softmax-style
reduction-broadcast chains.
---
